## Attribution

This DDR5 PHY UVM Verification project is based on and derived from the
Si-Vision DDR5 PHY Verification Project:

- **Original Project**: https://github.com/Shehab-Naga/ddr5_phy
- **Original Authors**: Si-Vision Team & Ain Shams University
- **License**: Original project license applies to derived components

The verification methodology, test approach, and RTL design patterns follow
best practices from the DDR5 specification (JEDEC JESD79-5) and Accellera UVM
standard documentation.

For questions or attribution clarification, please refer to the main README.md file.
